  "description": "The \u0027dss_agenttools_live\u0027 dataset provides a comprehensive overview of various agent tools used within Dataiku projects. Each entry in the dataset represents a specific agent tool, detailing its unique identifier, name, type, and description. This dataset is particularly useful for managing and understanding the tools available in different Dataiku projects, as it includes metadata such as the project key, creator user, and last modification details. Additionally, it provides configuration parameters and quick test queries for each tool, which can be essential for developers and data scientists looking to integrate or troubleshoot these tools. The dataset also includes URLs for direct access to the tools within the Dataiku platform, enhancing usability and accessibility. This dataset is valuable for project management, tool auditing, and ensuring that the right tools are being used effectively across various projects.",
